flowchart TD
    Start((Start)) --> ReadPotentiometer[Read potentiometer value]
    ReadPotentiometer --> CheckMovement{Potentiometer<br/>moved >5%?}
    
    CheckMovement -->|yes| UpdateSpeed[Update servo_speed from potentiometer]
    CheckMovement -->|no| CheckRelay
    
    UpdateSpeed --> CheckRelay{Relay<br/>enabled?}
    
    CheckRelay -->|no| StopServo[Stop servo and set speed to 0]
    CheckRelay -->|yes| UpdateServo[Update servo position and angle]
    
    StopServo --> SignalDisplay[Signal display task]
    UpdateServo --> SignalDisplay
    
    SignalDisplay --> Loop((Loop every 50ms))
    Loop --> ReadPotentiometer

    note[Task: Control analog servo synchronized with relay state]